{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/e30e66784c8a8d2eb0ac574d32464ba7.poster.avif?t=1770657417\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/e30e66784c8a8d2eb0ac574d32464ba7.webm?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/e30e66784c8a8d2eb0ac574d32464ba7.mp4?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City 20. A secret nuclear city, quarantined after a radioactive leak and left to starve, a post-apocalyptic sandbox survival game where every choice shapes the world around you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>open-world survival experience</strong>, every decision is remembered. <strong>Factions</strong> guard their own agendas, people seek advantage, and the environment itself is a constant threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How far will you go to survive?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>world evolves whether you act or not</strong>. NPCs follow daily <strong>routines</strong>, adapt to a <strong>dynamic</strong> <strong>environment</strong>, and remember how you treat them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can help, trade, steal, or attack, but every action shapes your <strong>reputation</strong> with individuals and factions alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/4c6b6ce483d3905259adbca84595a80e.poster.avif?t=1770657417\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/4c6b6ce483d3905259adbca84595a80e.webm?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/4c6b6ce483d3905259adbca84595a80e.mp4?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with or against <strong>organized factions</strong> in this <strong>living open world simulation</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn trust</strong> to access shops, resources, and safe areas, or <strong>betray them</strong> and be hunted down, exiled, and shut out of their territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/3faeaa781d4cc0586cd1640b8fc87615.poster.avif?t=1770657417\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/3faeaa781d4cc0586cd1640b8fc87615.webm?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/3faeaa781d4cc0586cd1640b8fc87615.mp4?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every NPC has a life of their own: they work, rest, eat, and adapt to the <strong>living city</strong>. A hungry guard might trade intel for food; an insulted citizen might refuse to speak to you for days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help them, exploit them, or ignore them, and <strong>watch the city react</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/733026d820844d4cd0255840718156d6.poster.avif?t=1770657417\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/733026d820844d4cd0255840718156d6.webm?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/733026d820844d4cd0255840718156d6.mp4?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radiation is not the only threat. Shortly after your arrival, strange apparitions begin to flood the city's decaying streets. Facing this new terror, politics must be put aside and everyone must do their part to survive. Will you rally the factions to hold the line, or let the city fall to the unknown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/d712fa76a49ff3b4e4797b0f6ea502cc.poster.avif?t=1770657417\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/d712fa76a49ff3b4e4797b0f6ea502cc.webm?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/d712fa76a49ff3b4e4797b0f6ea502cc.mp4?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find food, craft survival tools, restore power, and endure hazards. Grow crops to cook hearty recipes, hunt and trap wildlife, or scavenge rare materials to trade with NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>no scripted path</strong>, each playthrough is unique as factions rise and fall, NPCs live or die, and alliances shift in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City 20 is in active development: we\u2019re expanding content, refining systems, and adding new features based on community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to follow the journey to 1.0 and be part of shaping the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1597980?t=1770657417","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770657417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/b19dfcd66542ab6e008fbbb3276c0fe478bf97ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770657417","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/b19dfcd66542ab6e008fbbb3276c0fe478bf97ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770657417","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Purchase, sale, use and abuse of both alcohol and drugs by the player's character and NPCs. \r\n\r\nUnarmed and weapon-based combat between characters."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2932760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p>Lights of Tomorrow was a true milestone for us, but the game is still far from done! Over the next few months, we'll be working on adding even more content, mechanics, NPCs, items, and storylines! Want to get a glimpse at what we're working on next? Check out our roadmap below!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/34866c3a8ec32442af781b8308fbeadd.avif?t=1770657417\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><br><h1>Join our Discord server!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/2ed9e59d0d5020189357cb3a74c10602.avif?t=1770657417\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/e30e66784c8a8d2eb0ac574d32464ba7.poster.avif?t=1770657417\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/e30e66784c8a8d2eb0ac574d32464ba7.webm?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/e30e66784c8a8d2eb0ac574d32464ba7.mp4?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City 20. A secret nuclear city, quarantined after a radioactive leak and left to starve, a post-apocalyptic sandbox survival game where every choice shapes the world around you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>open-world survival experience</strong>, every decision is remembered. <strong>Factions</strong> guard their own agendas, people seek advantage, and the environment itself is a constant threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How far will you go to survive?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>world evolves whether you act or not</strong>. NPCs follow daily <strong>routines</strong>, adapt to a <strong>dynamic</strong> <strong>environment</strong>, and remember how you treat them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can help, trade, steal, or attack, but every action shapes your <strong>reputation</strong> with individuals and factions alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/4c6b6ce483d3905259adbca84595a80e.poster.avif?t=1770657417\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/4c6b6ce483d3905259adbca84595a80e.webm?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/4c6b6ce483d3905259adbca84595a80e.mp4?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with or against <strong>organized factions</strong> in this <strong>living open world simulation</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn trust</strong> to access shops, resources, and safe areas, or <strong>betray them</strong> and be hunted down, exiled, and shut out of their territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/3faeaa781d4cc0586cd1640b8fc87615.poster.avif?t=1770657417\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/3faeaa781d4cc0586cd1640b8fc87615.webm?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/3faeaa781d4cc0586cd1640b8fc87615.mp4?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every NPC has a life of their own: they work, rest, eat, and adapt to the <strong>living city</strong>. A hungry guard might trade intel for food; an insulted citizen might refuse to speak to you for days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help them, exploit them, or ignore them, and <strong>watch the city react</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/733026d820844d4cd0255840718156d6.poster.avif?t=1770657417\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/733026d820844d4cd0255840718156d6.webm?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/733026d820844d4cd0255840718156d6.mp4?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radiation is not the only threat. Shortly after your arrival, strange apparitions begin to flood the city's decaying streets. Facing this new terror, politics must be put aside and everyone must do their part to survive. Will you rally the factions to hold the line, or let the city fall to the unknown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/d712fa76a49ff3b4e4797b0f6ea502cc.poster.avif?t=1770657417\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/d712fa76a49ff3b4e4797b0f6ea502cc.webm?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597980/extras/d712fa76a49ff3b4e4797b0f6ea502cc.mp4?t=1770657417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find food, craft survival tools, restore power, and endure hazards. Grow crops to cook hearty recipes, hunt and trap wildlife, or scavenge rare materials to trade with NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>no scripted path</strong>, each playthrough is unique as factions rise and fall, NPCs live or die, and alliances shift in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City 20 is in active development: we\u2019re expanding content, refining systems, and adding new features based on community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to follow the journey to 1.0 and be part of shaping the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Untold Games"],"dlc":[3216560],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","i